"Play sound from mirrored devices" = "播放鏡像裝置的聲音";
"Volume follows the mirroring device; adjust it there." = "音量跟隨鏡像裝置；請在裝置上調整。";
"Open iMirror at login" = "登入時開啟 iMirror";
"A new four-digit code is generated each time a new device pairs; no fixed code is stored. Verified devices can reconnect without a code." = "每次有新裝置配對時都會產生新的四位數驗證碼，不會儲存固定驗證碼。已驗證的裝置再次連線時不需要驗證碼。";
"Forget All Devices…" = "忘記所有裝置⋯";
