"Forget all paired devices?" = "要忘記所有已配對的裝置嗎？";
"Forget All Devices" = "忘記所有裝置";
"Each device will need a new code the next time it mirrors to this Mac." = "下次鏡像輸出到這部 Mac 時，每部裝置都需要輸入新的驗證碼。";
"Reset the receiver identity?" = "要重置接收器身分嗎？";
"Reset and Restart" = "重置並重新啟動";
"The receiver restarts, current mirroring stops and every device must verify again. This can’t be undone." = "接收器會重新啟動，目前的鏡像輸出會停止，所有裝置都需要重新驗證。此動作無法還原。";
"Cancel" = "取消";

/* Getting started guide */
"Welcome to iMirror" = "歡迎使用 iMirror";
"Mirror an iPhone, iPad or another Mac to this Mac" = "將 iPhone、iPad 或另一部 Mac 的螢幕鏡像輸出到這部 Mac";
"iMirror lives in the menu bar" = "iMirror 位於選單列";
"Click %@ in the menu bar for status and settings. iMirror has no Dock icon; that’s expected." = "按一下選單列中的 %@ 查看狀態和設定。iMirror 沒有 Dock 圖像，這是正常的。";
"Open Screen Mirroring on your iPhone or iPad" = "在 iPhone 或 iPad 上打開「螢幕鏡像輸出」";
"Swipe down from the top-right corner to open Control Center, then tap Screen Mirroring. On a Mac, use Control Center in the menu bar." = "從螢幕右上角向下滑動來打開控制中心，然後點一下「螢幕鏡像輸出」。在 Mac 上，請使用選單列中的控制中心。";
"Choose “%@”" = "選擇「%@」";
"The device and this Mac must be on the same Wi-Fi network. If macOS asks whether iMirror may access the local network, click Allow." = "裝置和這部 Mac 必須連接同一個 Wi-Fi 網路。如果 macOS 詢問是否允許 iMirror 存取區域網路，請按一下「允許」。";
"Enter the code the first time" = "第一次連線時輸入驗證碼";
"A four-digit code appears on this Mac; enter it on the device. The same device won’t need a code again." = "這部 Mac 上會顯示四位數驗證碼，在裝置上輸入即可。同一部裝置之後再連線就不需要驗證碼。";
"Use the mirroring window" = "使用鏡像視窗";
"Move the pointer over the picture to show the stop, pin and full-screen buttons in the top-left corner, or press Command-W to stop and Control-Command-F for full screen. Sound from the device plays on this Mac." = "將指標移到畫面上，左上角會顯示停止、置頂和全螢幕按鈕；也可以按 Command-W 停止，按 Control-Command-F 切換全螢幕。裝置的聲音會從這部 Mac 播放。";
"Get Started" = "開始使用";
"You can show this guide again any time from the iMirror menu." = "隨時可以從 iMirror 選單再次打開本指南。";

/* Mirroring window */
"Unpin" = "取消置頂";
"Keep on Top" = "保持置頂";

/* About window */
"A free, open-source AirPlay screen mirroring receiver for the Mac." = "免費、開放原始碼的 Mac AirPlay 螢幕鏡像輸出接收器。";

